==Description==
'''Triumph''' is a sticker that can be purchased in the store for {{Coins|200}}.

Previously it was a sticker obtained from the [[Ducky Revenge Event]]. It was obtained from Level 23 of the regular track, which had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|1,450}} or {{Robux|76}} ({{Robux|64}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) to unlock, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|8,210}} or {{Robux|1,642}} ({{Robux|1,384}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale). However, it ended up getting removed from the game and later brought back under a different name, though previous owners would lose the sticker.

==Appearance==
'''Triumph''' sticker showcases the default [[Minigunner]] with closed eyes and mouth. It has steam coming out of its nose. It plays the default sound effect for stickers when used. 

